Define a sequence $a_1, a_2, \ldots$ by $a_1 = 1$, $a_2 = 2$, $a_3 = 3$, and\[a_n = \begin{cases} 
      a_{n-1} + a_{n-2} & \text{if } n \text{ is prime} \\
      a_{n-1} \cdot a_{n-2} & \text{if } n \text{ is composite} \\
      a_{n-1} - a_{n-2} & \text{if } n \text{ is a perfect square}
   \end{cases}\]for $n > 3$. Find the remainder when $a_{2017}$ is divided by $1000$.
